WEBVTT

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:57.990
What's wrong?  Something's outside?

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.140
Ial-san!

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:17.380
Their Bond

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:28.620
Keep it down, everyone.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.520
Ial-san.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.810
I'm going to stitch up your wounds now.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:47.230
I know it will hurt, but please bear with it and stay completely still.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:49.420
Can you understand me?

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:51.520
If you do, please nod.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.740
I...

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.290
see...

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:49.110
On this night with the beautiful moon, we sleep next to each other,

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:57.310
and you can even hear the voices of the frogs.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:07.240
The voice of the bird of dawn sings

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:16.140
and it echoes throughout the lands.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:25.630
Don't cry.  Don't cry o bird of dawn.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:35.230
You remind me of your words.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:44.490
The morning mist dances, blown by breath.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:56.500
My dear child, have a sweet dream.

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:17.850
<i>I'm sure there are many things you can still protect with your right arm.</i>

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.990
Ial-san, does it hurt somewhere?

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:30.850
I'm fine.  I feel much better now.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:34.950
I'm sorry I woke you up.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.870
Are you thirsty at all?  I'll go get some water for you.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.270
No, I'll leave right away.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:48.560
You can't move yet!

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.340
The wounds will open!

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:53.100
I don't want to cause you any trouble.

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:56.940
I'm being pursued.

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.160
What happened?

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.860
Damiya poisoned me.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.170
"Poison?!"

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.530
Why would Damiya-sama do that to you?

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:18.710
Damiya feared that his assassination scheme against Harumiya-sama the Queen would come to light... and so he tried to kill me.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.670
He planned the assassination of Harumiya-sama?!

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:30.470
The raid was Damiya's conspiracy.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:35.930
The teacher from Kazalm was one of Damiya's men, too.

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:38.830
Kiriku-sensei was?!

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:50.870
I must go now.  I can't involve you with this any further.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:57.010
You mustn't move now!

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:05.360
Since you came here intending to rely on me, then rely on me until the end.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:40.920
<i>Do you plan upon willingly casting away what's precious to you?</i>

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:44.630
<i>So Erin was being betrayed by her fellow teacher.</i>

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:49.630
This would be the only place that man would come.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.100
Um...

00:08:58.620 --> 00:08:59.550
Shouldn't you lie down-

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:02.060
No, this is fine.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:05.070
I have a request.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:09.030
Could I listen to you play the harp?

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.190
I want to hear your pure tune.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.350
Sure.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.470
Damiya-sama.

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:58.260
Did you lose him?

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:00.360
My apologies.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:04.560
You're a useless man at critical moments.

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:10.330
I've lost faith in you.  Leave to wherever you wish.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.980
The blood leads toward Lazal.

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:42.050
Looks like they're here.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.600
I'll go check.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.030
You can't move yet!

00:11:58.700 --> 00:11:59.910
Ial-san.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:06.500
Will you...  Will you... trust me?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.560
Calm down, Owl.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:19.840
Damiya-sama.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.260
There's blood on the straw.

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:24.510
Erin.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.070
Where's Ial?

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:29.960
What's the point in hiding him?

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:33.520
It's obvious that Ial was here.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.530
I see.  So you like him.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:44.280
That's fine.  If you want to cover for him, do so.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.650
He'll soon be found.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:59.640
He's a poor man who was sold for one bag of large gold nuggets.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:05.340
He's a man who can live only as a shield for the Queen.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:11.940
He's a foolish man who doesn't understand the grandness of those who are related to the royal family.

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:19.990
That man can't do anything.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.950
But you're different.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:28.900
You can control beast-lords, and you're smarter than anyone.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:36.890
Since you're so smart, you should already know that you have no choice but to obey your destiny.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.640
Seems he's no longer here.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.490
Okay.  Let's look elsewhere.

00:13:42.490 --> 00:13:44.720
He couldn't have gone far.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:45.660
Sir!

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:54.940
Thank you, Lilan.  We're fine now.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.670
It's okay now.

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:03.920
I'm sorry about this.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:10.410
This is the second time you've saved me.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:13.090
To cover me like that...

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:18.830
These beast-lords must trust you from their very core.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:24.550
I think it's because I'm not acting alert over you.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:31.260
Beast-lords can sense people's emotions extremely well.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:34.980
That demonstration you performed at Lazal Beast-lord Care Center...

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:40.070
Is that the reason why they didn't obey Ouri's harp?

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.010
You know what happened there?

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.490
I heard from my contacts.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:52.240
Part of it was likely that the beast-lords sensed his fear toward them.

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:59.750
But also, while raising the beast-lords, he must have blown the mute whistle many times.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:08.970
Beast-lords will never open up their hearts to those who have blown the mute whistle against them.

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:17.230
That's why the beast-lords here will listen to my harp, but not his.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:23.120
It isn't related to me being an Akun Me Chai or any secret power of the Mist People.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:26.110
I see.

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:38.750
I wanted to raise Lilan like other beast-lords in the wild, so I never used the mute whistle or benetrophic water.

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:48.090
But, if the bond we made were to be used as a tool for war,

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:54.760
then I always thought that I would just have to disappear.

00:15:58.530 --> 00:16:04.350
But even if I die now, people will continue to kill each other,

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:07.450
Touda will be used as disposable tools of war,

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:12.410
and beast-lords will continue to be raised at care centers as a symbol of power.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:25.220
So it's your dream to see that not come to pass?

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:35.470
I was having a dream as I slept.

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:39.870
My father was playing a harp.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:44.190
He was a master craftsman of harps.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.870
The harps he crafted made the most gentle sounds.

00:16:49.970 --> 00:17:00.000
I was thinking that I would one day become a harp craftsman as well, craft them at his side, and allow Mother to have an easy life.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.990
Why did you become a Sezan?

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:06.080
To live on.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:10.900
Father died, and my sister was still very little.

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:16.140
If I became a Sezan, they would receive enough money to live out the rest of their lives.

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:22.310
When I heard the tune you made with that harp,

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:26.570
I felt something very warm.

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:34.270
It felt like I was with my late mother.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:46.740
If you're being chased, you're no longer a Sezan, right?

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:51.780
Aren't you able to live as you wish from now on?

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:54.390
As I wish?

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:57.330
So you could become a harp craftsman as your father was.

00:17:58.040 --> 00:17:59.560
With a family surrounding me?

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.080
I can't live a life like that anymore.

00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:13.990
A Sezan is a living shield.

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:18.290
They live only to protect the Queen and her descendants.

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:25.580
We sever all links with family to avoid having any weaknesses.

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.790
We're not permitted to take a wife, either.

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:39.510
Besides, I've killed too many.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:43.460
I can still see the faces of those I've killed.

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:46.980
Killing people does that to you and I would not wish to free myself from that.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:52.400
The Grand Duke's soldiers must feel the same way.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:58.450
This country was protected through battles soaked in their blood and fear.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:37.320
Your life is just like that of a Touda.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:46.290
You're a lonely beast separated from their mother while still wrapped in an egg and then raised only to fight.

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:50.330
But you're not a Touda!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.580
You shouldn't be a tool manipulated by humans.

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:04.850
You're right.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:11.400
If a Touda master became the ruler...

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:16.060
Ial-san.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:20.040
What if we told Seimiya-sama the truth behind Damiya-sama?

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:23.480
Is there any way to meet up with Seimiya-sama?

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.610
Right.  You might be able to do this.

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:55.230
Will you do it?

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.190
Yes.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.120
Anything that I can do.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:07.070
I will continue to fight with this arm you saved, believing that there are still things I can trust in.

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:13.760
For the sake of the late Harumiya-sama, I will fight until the last moment.

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:25.140
So... you've lived for the Queen all this time, just like that.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:30.760
You're actually a kind person who thinks about family.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:35.730
The mute whistle that would tie you down is gone, you know?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:44.990
Why?  Why won't you grasp happiness of your own with this right hand?

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:05.450
Those who are the Queen of Ryoza
are literally the path to the gods.

00:24:05.450 --> 00:24:09.900
They have governed this country with pure hearts from the time of the Founding Queen, Je.

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:14.190
And I, Queen Seimiya, continue that trend.

00:24:14.190 --> 00:24:17.280
The trend which will never change.

00:24:17.280 --> 00:24:21.780
But Shunan, do you really think Ryoza
is about to come to an end?

00:24:21.780 --> 00:24:25.050
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Pure Night.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:26:00.070
Pure Night
